00:13:51,960 --> 00:14:01,480
I think it's a very important aspect of not only Western culture but also in general assuming guilt when it's your fault.

248
00:14:01,480 --> 00:14:08,240
In this case we saw that the employee didn't really want to accept the fact that it was his fault.

249
00:14:08,240 --> 00:14:12,720
He didn't say yeah I know it was me I'm sorry and this is my plan to fix it.

250
00:14:13,280 --> 00:14:20,000
Now this is very important among cultures because in some cultures the aspect of losing face is so important right?

251
00:14:20,640 --> 00:14:21,640
Right.

252
00:14:21,640 --> 00:14:26,140
So somebody may not really want to assume guilt or they have to because it's part of the culture.

253
00:14:26,760 --> 00:14:29,320
But what's the standard in North American business practice?

254
00:14:30,040 --> 00:14:41,120
I would say that you would have to assume responsibility and take responsibility for your actions right and say yes it's my fault I did it but I'm going to get it fixed or I'll do it or I'll make up for it.

255
00:14:42,200 --> 00:14:46,510
So some good business tips here today in this lesson.

256
